{
 "id": "0a5f94bb-e9be-441d-afa7-e6f70e0f75fe",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Another Tonight"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "어나더 투나잇"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Jieunsoo was unilaterally divorced by her husband Yutaehan three years ago.\nShe believed she was over it—no longer caring who he dated or remarried.\n\nThat is, until she finds out he's planning to marry Yujeongha—the very woman she spent her whole life envying.\n\nDriven by anger and desperation, Jieunsoo decides to sabotage the wedding the only way she knows how—by spending a night with her ex-husband.\n\n“I’m going to tell Yujeongha.”\n“Tell her what?”\n“That we slept together.”\n\nShe lays down her carefully held card like a dagger from the heart. This was always the plan—hard-earned and calculated.\nNow it was time to make her demand.\n\n“I don’t want Yujeongha.”\n\nSaying it out loud stings more than she expected. But she's a mother—and as a mother, her child mattered more than her pride.\nThere’s no way she could leave her child in the hands of a woman who despised her.\n\n“Say it.”\n\nHis low voice was calm, unreadable.\nLowering her gaze, trembling, Jieunsoo finally looks up at the man and says:\n\n“Tell her we slept together.”"
  },
